      "value": "@{5b7c3929d5fc6b20af6b960a|full_name}: That sounds like a good idea as well.  I mostly look for anything that will solve this fundamental issue that's been around since forever.\nThough i wonder how that applies when someone setting the nearplane on their avatar camera to 0.001 using the forced mode, can also make the menu unusable??  Salbug showed this here: https://files.catbox.moe/gqumd7.mp4",
